# Pilot Rouhi and the pilots' shed on Lodestone Quay (CIPlay lodestone_quay_talk, 11-11 w06; in a test world 'CI ...').
# Points as in the recipe: Rouhi fishing off the quay's edge at -3 -76; the pilots' shed from -12 to -18 and -70 to -76
# (push yaw 180), its door (lqsheddoor) at -14.25 -70 facing inland, the hidden chest at -16.5 -74.5. The door is barred
# before anyone talked to her; her three answers (journal, the orchard, four stones); then the door opens on the chest.
island Lodestone Quay keep
offset 0 0
hour 11
weather Calm
expect hidden lqshedchest

# The shed door: barred before anyone talked to Rouhi
at -14.25 -67.5 h=1.6
use lqsheddoor stay
expect message shed is barred
expect shown lqsheddoor
expect hidden lqshedchest

# Pilot Rouhi on the quay's edge
snap lq_islander Pilot Rouhi 0 3.5 0.6
use Pilot Rouhi
expect step 0
use Pilot Rouhi pick 1
expect message lodestone under the sea
use Pilot Rouhi pick 2
expect message trees that grow upward
use Pilot Rouhi pick 3
expect message four stones
expect item Stone 4

# Now the shed opens on the chest
at -14.25 -67.5 h=1.6
use lqsheddoor stay
expect message pilots' shed
expect hidden lqsheddoor
expect shown lqshedchest
open Pilots' shed chest
wait 2
expect item Rope 2
picture lq_shed -14.25 4 -66 -15 2 -73
